# Waiting List Programs

Features
Add a person to the waiting list.

Prevent duplicate names from being added.

Serve the person at the front of the line.

Check whether a person is already in the waiting list.

Display the current number of people waiting.

Show the waiting list in the order people will be served.

Handle invalid input such as blank names.


Menu Options
When the program starts, it displays a menu with these options:

Add person

Serve person

Check if person is in list

Show waiting list size

Display waiting list

Exit



